  "body": "It might be useful to add `print` attribute to `<a>` tags, so browser will open printing page. Instead of using `window.print()` js function: it looks unnative.\r\n\r\nWe already have `download` attribute: `<a href=\"image.webp\" download />`.\r\nSimilar to this, the `print` attribute will look like: `<a href=\"image.webp\" print/>`.",
